:: Carter House Normal Snack [nobr]

/* Intro */
<<set $Minutes += 10>>
As you are walking through <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>’s kitchen with him, there is a sudden dual rumbling noise that echoes throughout the room. You both freeze, <span style="color:Pink">blushing slightly as you realize it was both of your stomachs crying out in the presence of food.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Guess we’re on the same snack schedule.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> laughs, rubbing the back of his head, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Care for a peanut butter and jelly sandwich? I’m allowed to make those on my own.”</span> <br>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Happy",
            },
        },
        {
            Name: "Carter",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Everyday",
                Mouth: "Happy",
            },
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

You accept his offer and watch as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> cutely grabs a stool and uses it to retrieve the peanut butter and bread from the pantry. He then grabs some jelly and begins to make you both a sandwich. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“How much peanut butter do you like? Does this look good? I cut my crusts off, what about you?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> <span style="color:Pink">asks you many questions as he goes, obviously wanting to make the simple sandwich exactly to your tastes. It’s adorable how much effort he puts into it.</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Here you are! One PB&J!”</span> He places it down in front of you are the counter and you both sit on the stools and eat while chatting about. <span style="color:LightGreen">You gotta admit, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> makes a damn good PB&J!</span> <br>
<<needChange "Hunger" 15>>
<<socialChange "Carter" 1>>
<span style="color:green">+Carter Energy</span><br>
<<set $HangOutNeed.Energy += 10>>
<br>
[[Continue|Carter House Kitchen]]
